{"id":"wb-7-1444","name":"毓秀桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"毓秀桥 (韩城)","text":"毓秀桥位于中国陕西省韩城市城南涺水之上，金城街道南关，俗称南桥，是一座十孔石拱桥，2003年被列为第四批陕西省文物保护单位，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%AF%93%E7%A7%80%E6%A1%A5_(%E9%9F%A9%E5%9F%8E)","revisionId":92142913,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92142913","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2f495efd8d269bc787127f25.jpg","title":"Hancheng_City.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hancheng_City.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/Hancheng_City.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Chlukoe","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","caption":"Hancheng City. View from the old Bridge. In Front the old City, on top the modern City. Hancheng, Shaanxi.","width":320,"height":213}}